<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE - GEVEKE H1 NET PROFIT RISES.</title>
<headline>TABLE - GEVEKE H1 NET PROFIT RISES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     3.70 vs   3.24</p>
<p>    Net profit			    13.0  vs  11.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Technical wholesaler Geveke NV previously said it</p>
<p>expected profits to rise in 1997. </p>
<p>    Turnover			     537.0  vs 500.9</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    21.8  vs  18.8</p>
<p>    Net financial charges		3.0  vs   2.8</p>
<p>    Tax					5.8  vs   4.8</p>
<p>    Minorities charge		    nil  vs   0.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Geveke said it had adjusted its 1996 figures for the</p>
<p>previous sale of its stake in unit ICE.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
